{"item_uid": "學測84-social-057", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 84, "year_ce": 1995, "subject_key": "social", "subject_zh": "社會", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 57, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "仲武應徵從戎，其軍旅生活有那些特色？\n(甲)糧食衣裝均須自備 (乙)平時農閒兼習戰陣 (丙)定期應調入京宿衛\n(丁)子女必須世襲軍職 (戊)每歲定時負擔搖役", "options": {"A": "甲乙丙", "B": "甲乙戊", "C": "甲丙丁", "D": "乙丁戊", "E": "丙丁戊\n-9-\n社會考科 第 10 頁\n共 14 頁"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": "56-57", "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf"}
{"item_uid": "學測84-social-058", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 84, "year_ce": 1995, "subject_key": "social", "subject_zh": "社會", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 58, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "希特勒願意與史達林綁在一起的主要原\n因是什麼？", "options": {"A": "化解德國東顧之憂，俾全力對付英法", "B": "消除俄國對日德反共公約的疑慮", "C": "方便德國與東南歐獨裁政權聯繫", "D": "誘使俄國轉向巴爾幹半島求發展"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": "58-59", "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf"}
{"item_uid": "學測84-social-059", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 84, "year_ce": 1995, "subject_key": "social", "subject_zh": "社會", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 59, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "兩人連腳就綁後，對世局造成什麼影\n響？", "options": {"A": "希特勒乘機進占奧國與捷克", "B": "刺激美國首度實施平時徵兵", "C": "德俄兩國進而協議瓜分波蘭 圖8", "D": "日本受鼓舞而發動七七事變"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": "58-59", "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf"}
